9,Beautiful & Useful Piedmontese Words and Phrases | solosophie,https://www.solosophie.com/beautiful-useful-piedmontese-words-and-phrases/,"The capital of Piedmont is Turin, and the region even has its own Romance language, Piedmontese. Also known as Piemontèis or Lenga Piemontèisa, and in Italian, Piemontese, Here are some beautiful and useful Piedmontese words and phrases!",Piedmontese,Indo-European
